# d3mon light: flat, warm off-white surfaces, one accent.
# Titlebar (Header, WM) uses the window colour, as in the dark scheme.
#
# Palette: bg #f2f3ef, panel #fbfbf9, raise #e6e8e2, ink #10120e,
# dim #5c6058, accent #4f8f00 (ink #ffffff), ok #3a7d00,
# warn #a35f00, bad #c42b1f.
#
# Selection is a soft green (#c8e2a0, paler #dfeccf when the window is
# unfocused) with dark ink, not a solid accent fill; focus rings and
# hover (DecorationFocus/Hover) keep the accent.

